DESCRIPTION:A spooky Halloween event in Davis will feature live music performances and a special opening DJ set by Ghoulie Julie. Costumes or goth wear are highly encouraged but not required. \nLive music performances by:\n-Rose Lyon\n-In Retrograde\n-Killer Couture\n-Special opening DJ set by Ghoulie Julie \nCostumes or goth wear are highly encouraged but not required. \nAdmission is $10–15 sliding scale / NOTAFLOF (No One Turned Away For Lack Of Funds).
