SUMMARY:Seka Hills Olive Crush Festival
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our annual Olive Crush Festival on Sunday\, November 1st as we celebrate the vibrant olive crush season full of flavor\, food\, & fun! The event is open to the public and free of charge. \n\n\nOlive Mill Tours (Free of charge\, no ticket needed) – 11:30a\, 12:30p\, 1:30p\, 2:30p \n\n\nOlive Oil Tastings – 11:00a to 3:00p \n\n\nArtisan Deli – 11:00a to 3:00p \n\n\nLocal Vendor Fair – 11:00a to 3:00p \n\n\nLive Music featuring The Sun Followers – 11:30a to 2:30p \n\n\nCooking Demo by Tribal Executive Chef Casey Willard – 12:00pm \n\n\nFood Trucks: Maiz Mexican & Compa’s Catering – 11:00a to 3:00p
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/seka-hills-olive-crush-festival/
LOCATION:Seka Hills\, 19326 Road 78\, Brooks\, 95606\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Seka-Hills-1-Seka-Hills.jpg
END:VEVENT
