SUMMARY:Davis Film Festival
DESCRIPTION:The 2026 Davis Film Festival takes place SUNDAY NOVEMBER 1ST FROM 2:00 PM-9:30 PM at the Veteran’s Memorial Theater\, 203 E. 14th Street in Davis\, CA. (PLENTY OF FREE PARKING). Films from around the world and our own backyard. Narrative\, documentary\, animation\, experimental\, shorts and features. \nTickets are $15 for VIP pass\, $10 general admission\, or $8.50 students/seniors.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/davis-film-festival/
LOCATION:Davis Veterans Memorial Theater\, 277 E. 14th Street\, Davis CA\, Davis\, 95616\, United States
END:VEVENT
