SUMMARY:Winters Open Mic
DESCRIPTION:Live musicians and poets ranging from new to well-seasoned performers. Come eat\, drink\, and enjoy local artists. Sign up to be on stage\, and become one of our supportive\, collaborative community members. \n\nFree entry\, donations encouraged\nAll ages welcome\nAll genres and instruments welcome\nSign-ups start at 5:30 PM\nEvent starts at 6:00 PM\nEveryone who signs up\, plays\nEach time slot is 10 minutes\, or 2 pieces\, whichever is shorter\nWhen time allows\, artists can sign up for a second time slot (once announced by the event leader)\nVolunteers needed! Contact wintersopenmic@gmail.com if interested in learning how to contributed\n\nWinters Open Mic is a 501(c)3 Non-profit organization with the simple mission of encouraging and providing space for performers to perform. \nFor any questions\, contact wintersopenmic@gmail.com
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/winters-open-mic/2026-11-06/
LOCATION:Winters Opera House\, 13 Main Street\, Winters\, 95694\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/fb.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Winters Open Mic":MAILTO:wintersopenmic@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
